{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13107170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13107170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310717001:0":{"text":"마법사님, 잠깐만요...! 또 마법을 잘못 쓰셨어요!","source_cn":"魔法师先生，请等等——你又用错魔法了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB99A0B43AE05774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310717002:0":{"text":"당신이 쓰려는 마법은 생명력을 키우는 마법이라 생명이 없는 물체에는 쓸 수 없어요. 그랬다가는 통제를 잃게 될 거예요!","source_cn":"你准备使用的魔法是增强生命力的，不能给无生命物体使用，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2862E820CCD1E4D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310717003:0":{"text":"네? 그럴 리가요! 제 마법서에는 이렇게 쓰여있는걸요!","source_cn":"什么？不可能！我的法术书上是这么写的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F4AB970AB7C2317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1310717003":{"text":"네? 그럴 리가요! 제 마법서에는 이렇게 쓰여있는걸요!","source_cn":"什么？不可能！我的法术书上是这么写的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F4AB970AB7C2317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310717004:0":{"text":"흥, 제가 제대로 가르쳐 드리죠! \n어라, 그러고 보니... “살아있지 않은 생물에 사용하면 안 된다”...라고...","source_cn":"哼，让我来教教你！\\n咦，好像确实……“不能对非活性物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6C9FBE3E340621E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310717006:0":{"text":"다... 당신이 굉장한 마법사라는 건가요?","source_cn":"你……难道是个很厉害的魔法师？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA57F88EDEFB131A5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다... 당신이 굉장한 마법사라는 건가요?","female":"다... 당신이 굉장한 마법사라는 건가요?","variant_male_record_index":"144690","variant_female_record_index":"144691","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310717007:0":{"text":"최고의 마법사죠!","source_cn":"——是最厉害的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF932F24A8DB77F15","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"최고의 마법사죠!","female":"최고의 마법사죠!","variant_male_record_index":"144692","variant_female_record_index":"144693","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310717008:0":{"text":"어디 보자... 아이 참, 여러분을 만나서 정말 다행이네요. 이제 어떻게 하면 될까요?","source_cn":"让我想想……哎呀，幸好碰见了你们，那我接下来该怎么做呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F7D419AAD03AB8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1310717008":{"text":"어디 보자... 아이 참, 여러분을 만나서 정말 다행이네요. 이제 어떻게 하면 될까요?","source_cn":"让我想想……哎呀，幸好碰见了你们，那我接下来该怎么做呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F7D419AAD03AB8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310717009:0":{"text":"그런 거였군요. 어쩐지 어딘가 이상하다고 생각하긴 했어요.","source_cn":"原来是这样，我就说好像哪里不对劲。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B8B51